%F A402483 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^(2*j)/((1 - x^(3*j))*(1 - x^(3*j-1))*(1 - x^(3*j-2))).
%F A402483 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / n^(3/4), where d = 8.65281866695040135457137... (the same as in A402472) and c = 0.0956592192785349108676...
